<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy — The Most Affordable DQ Breakfast</h2>
  <p>Priced at just $3.99, the DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy holds the title for the most budget-friendly, sit-down breakfast plate on the <a href="/categories/breakfast">DQ breakfast menu</a>. While the <a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">Breakfast Burrito</a> might be slightly cheaper at $3.49, the Biscuit &amp; Gravy provides significantly more volume and a deeply satisfying, home-cooked feel that simply can't be beat. You can explore our full morning lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>What Makes DQ Country Gravy Special</h2>
  <p>Our signature country gravy is a rich, white cream-based sauce perfectly seasoned with a blend of savory herbs and cracked black pepper. This iconic gravy is a fan-favorite that elevates several DQ menu items, including our Biscuit &amp; Gravy, the massive <a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a>, and it even serves as the ultimate dipping companion for the <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a>. Its bold, comforting flavor is truly a staple of DQ's hot food menu.</p>
  <h2>DQ Breakfast Menu Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Breakfast Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Biscuit &amp; Gravy</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>400</td><td>Classic Southern comfort</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">Breakfast Burrito</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>380</td><td>Portable, slightly lighter</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Chicken &amp; Gravy Burrito</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>450</td><td>Heartier, chicken + gravy</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.99</td><td>860</td><td>Complete DQ breakfast</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Availability Reminder</h2>
  <p>Please keep in mind that the DQ breakfast menu is exclusively served at <strong>select locations</strong>, predominantly found across the Southern and Midwestern United States. We highly recommend calling your local Dairy Queen to confirm their morning hours before making the trip. Breakfast is typically served until around 10:30 AM.</p>
