<h2>Biscuit &amp; Gravy — DQ's Southern Heritage</h2>
<p>Embracing the rich traditions of Southern U.S. comfort food, the DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy is a defining pillar of our breakfast lineup. The secret lies in our signature country gravy—a thick, pepper-spiced cream sauce that delivers an unforgettable savory kick. This iconic flavor profile can also be found smothered over the <a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a> or served alongside our legendary <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a> as a savory dip. View all our hearty options on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
